#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:2
msgid "Unable to Delete Tenant"
msgstr "No se puede eliminar el Inquilino"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:4
msgid "Problem"
msgstr "Problema"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:5
msgid ""
"When trying to delete a tenant, a message stating manage resources must "
"be removed or other error occurs and the tenant is not deleted. The "
"tenant may be stuck in a deleting status or return to OK status after "
"delete attempt."
msgstr ""
"Al intentar eliminar un inquilino, aparece un mensaje indicando que los "
"recursos administrados deben ser eliminados u ocurre otro error y el "
"inquilino no se elimina. El inquilino puede quedar atascado en estado de "
"eliminación o volver al estado OK después del intento de eliminación."

#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:7
msgid "Cause"
msgstr "Causa"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:8
msgid ""
"All managed resources must be removed from a tenant in order for that "
"tenant to be deleted. This includes instances and their underlying "
"managed vm's"
msgstr ""
"Todos los recursos administrados deben ser eliminados de un inquilino "
"para que ese inquilino pueda ser eliminado. Esto incluye instancias y sus"
" VM administradas subyacentes"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:10
msgid "Solution"
msgstr "Solución"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:11
msgid "Login or impersonate that an Admin user inside the tenant"
msgstr "Inicie sesión o suplante a un usuario Administrador dentro del inquilino"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:12
msgid "Navigate to Infrastructure > Hosts"
msgstr "Navegue a Infraestructura > Hosts"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:13
msgid "Under Hosts and VM's, delete any managed resources"
msgstr "En Hosts y VMs, elimine cualquier recurso administrado"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:15
msgid ""
"Uncheck ``remove infrastructure`` when deleting a VM to only remove it "
"from |morpheus| but not from the underlying hypervisor/cloud"
msgstr ""
"Desmarque ``remove infrastructure`` al eliminar una VM para solo "
"eliminarla de |morpheus| pero no del hipervisor/nube subyacente"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:16
msgid ""
"You must check ``remove associated instances`` if the VM has an "
"associated instance"
msgstr ""
"Debe marcar ``remove associated instances`` si la VM tiene una instancia "
"asociada"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:17
msgid ""
"If the VM no longer exists but there is still a record in |morpheus|, "
"uncheck ``remove infrastructure`` and check ``force delete``"
msgstr ""
"Si la VM ya no existe pero todavía hay un registro en |morpheus|, "
"desmarque ``remove infrastructure`` y marque ``force delete``"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:18
msgid ""
"Once all managed resources are removed from the tenant, the tenant can "
"then be deleted"
msgstr ""
"Una vez que todos los recursos administrados se eliminen del inquilino, "
"el inquilino puede ser eliminado"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:19
msgid ""
"In certain situations other components may prevent a tenant from being "
"deleted. If you have removed all managed resources from a tenant and the "
"tenant still cannot be deleted, please contact |morpheus| support"
msgstr ""
"En ciertas situaciones, otros componentes pueden impedir que un inquilino"
" sea eliminado. Si ha eliminado todos los recursos administrados de un "
"inquilino y el inquilino aún no puede ser eliminado, contacte al soporte "
"de |morpheus|"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:21
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Advertencia"

#: ../../troubleshooting/Unable_To_Delete_Tenant.rst:21
msgid ""
"Managed resources can also be removed by deleting instances, but be aware"
" this will delete VM's associated with the instance from the underlying "
"hypervisor/cloud"
msgstr ""
"Los recursos administrados también pueden eliminarse borrando instancias,"
" pero tenga en cuenta que esto eliminará las VMs asociadas con la "
"instancia del hipervisor/nube subyacente"

